@ApiService_HostAddress = http://localhost:5588
@Keycloak_HostAddress = http://localhost:8080

### Get a token from Keycloak (copy the access_token into @accessToken)
POST {{Keycloak_HostAddress}}/realms/cases/protocol/openid-connect/token
Content-Type: application/x-www-form-urlencoded

client_id=api&username=demo&password=demo&grant_type=password

###
@accessToken = paste-token-here

GET {{ApiService_HostAddress}}/
Accept: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

###